WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Who made the decisions on discipline?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.200
For instance, if one of your players, that you coached personally,

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.700
one of your position players were to get out of line, who would reprimand the player?

4
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:21.820
Well, of course there would be some dialogue with the position coach and the player,

5
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:31.100
but the . . . Any discipline other than a chewing out would come from the head football coach.

6
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:40.600
He usually assigned . . . to the position coach, to oversee whatever discipline he meted out.

7
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:51.160
For instance, Coach [Paul] Dietzel had a policy of having the player get up early,

8
00:00:51.160 --> 00:01:01.460
say at five o’clock or five-thirty, before breakfast, and go out to the stadium and run the stadium.

9
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:11.040
And the position coach would go with his position players and watch them run the stadium, whether it was pouring down rain or not.
